      },
      "text": "Other domains used by IHEATE also overlapped with servers used by IXESHE. Two domains ( ipv6pro[.]root[.]sx and gimeover[.]psp-moscow[.]com ) were used by IHEATE and resolved to the IP address 200[.]93[.]193[.]163 . At approximately the same time, IXESHE also used the same server – except it did so by accessing the domain skype[.]silksky[.]com .",
